export_decorator.velt:5:1: error: `velt_main` can't be the C name of an `@export` function
  = note: names starting with `velt_` are the Velt runtime's

export_decorator.velt:8:1: error: `@export` doesn't apply to a generic function: C calls one function, with one signature
  = note: C calls an exported function directly, with the C calling convention

export_decorator.velt:14:15: error: parameter `s` of an `@export` function has type `string`, which can't cross from C
  = note: C passes integers (`i8` … `u64`, `isize`, `usize`), `f32`, `f64`, `bool`, `Ptr<T>` and `Ptr<T> | null` (velt/ffi), as a `declare c` function's do, and `void` as the result

export_decorator.velt:21:1: error: two functions are exported to C as `lib_twice`

